          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"version\":\"design_judgment_v1\",\"case_key\":\"4052de4afd171be50d2045cf\",\"status\":\"scored\",\"units\":[{\"unit_id\":\"task_requirements\",\"applicability_rationale\":\"The balance totals, cheapest same-date business itinerary, payment limit, and conditional replacement request define the active task.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0006\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0008\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0009\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0010\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0013\"}],\"rationale\":\"Requires retrieving and totaling balances, comparing eligible itineraries, applying payment constraints, and checking the Mastercard charge before booking.\",\"applicability\":\"required\",\"levels\":{\"reasoning\":3,\"tool_use\":3,\"information\":3}},{\"unit_id\":\"reference_001\",\"applicability_rationale\":\"The existing reservation is basic economy, the scenario requests cancellation and rebooking when its flights cannot be changed, and the completion design specifies cancellation.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0287\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0094\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0009\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0150\"}],\"rationale\":\"Locate and verify the reservation, obtain the cancellation reason, check eligibility and confirmation, then bind its ID to the cancellation action.\",\"applicability\":\"selected_conditional\",\"levels\":{\"reasoning\":2,\"tool_use\":2,\"information\":2}},{\"unit_id\":\"reference_002\",\"applicability_rationale\":\"The scenario's Mastercard ceiling permits the documented $1786 charge, and the completion design specifies a replacement booking.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0013\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0136\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0151\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0156\"}],\"rationale\":\"Select priced business segments for three passengers and bind their dates, identities, and constrained payment split into a nested booking request.\",\"applicability\":\"selected_conditional\",\"levels\":{\"reasoning\":3,\"tool_use\":3,\"information\":3}}],\"dimensions\":{\"workload\":{\"level\":3,\"rationale\":\"Balance reporting, reservation review, itinerary comparison, cancellation, payment planning, and replacement booking form substantial multi-stage work across linked records.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0005\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0008\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0150\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0151\"}]},\"reasoning\":{\"level\":3,\"rationale\":\"The agent must reconcile cheapest eligible flights, the one-certificate limit, available balances, and the strict Mastercard ceiling; this does not require a broader recovery tree.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0008\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0068\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0013\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0136\"}]},\"tool_use\":{\"level\":3,\"rationale\":\"Profile and reservation retrieval, direct and connecting-flight searches, and two distinct write actions require repeated entity binding and a nested booking payload.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0226\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0221\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0171\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0172\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0153\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0196\"}]},\"dependencies\":{\"level\":3,\"rationale\":\"Reservation facts govern cancellation eligibility; itinerary price and payment allocation govern whether booking is authorized; both writes depend on explicit confirmation and linked records.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0112\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0115\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0019\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0013\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0150\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0151\"}]},\"information\":{\"level\":3,\"rationale\":\"Balances and payment identities come from the profile, dates and passenger details from the reservation, and comparable prices and seats from flight searches; these must be reconciled rather than treated as user-supplied facts.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0226\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0221\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0171\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0172\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0293\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0287\"}]}},\"overall_score\":75,\"intended_endpoint\":{\"description\":\"Communicate the $327 gift-card total and $1000 certificate total; subject to eligibility and explicit confirmations, cancel K1NW8N and book the cheapest qualifying business round trip without baggage or insurance, disclosing the $1786 Mastercard charge before booking.\",\"evidence\":[{\"citation_id\":\"E0139\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0151\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0152\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0019\"},{\"citation_id\":\"E0013\"}]},\"dependency_reasoning\":\"The profile supplies balances and the reservation ID; reservation review supplies dates, passengers, cabin, and cancellation eligibility. Flight comparison and the permitted payment split establish the charge against the user's ceiling before confirmation and writes. Cancellation and booking are linked, but their reference order alone is not proof of feasibility.\",\"score_rationale\":\"Five levels of 3 yield 5 × 15 = 75: substantial linked work with interacting pricing and policy constraints, complex booking arguments, and distributed discovery, without evidence of extensive recovery orchestration.\",\"uncertainties\":[\"Only selected flight records are supplied, so the complete search-result space and proof that this itinerary is globally cheapest are unavailable.\",\"The scenario conditions the cancellation request on being told basic economy cannot be changed; the initial reservation and completion design support selecting that branch, but no interaction is observed.\",\"Confirmation and cancellation-reason responses are not supplied; they are prerequisites, not assumed observed events.\"],\"source_quality_flags\":[\"Initial records are judge-only design context, not facts already known to the task agent.\",\"Native reference actions describe intended writes, not an executed trace or authoritative ordering.\",\"Initial_state is null; no setup changes are documented.\"],\"unscorable_reason\":\"\"}",
          "type": "output_text",
          "logprobs": []
        }
